tmp_text "  Argh ! Ack ! Thbbbth ! I had a chat with one of those disgusting \"Legend \" players the other day. He had about 1000 hp and 1500 sp. That'splain horrible - please, please don't do that to the guild , Mangla ! I agree with your sentiments about legends. They do ruin a guild. Whatthe !\"!#%&&#! is the point with guilds, if everyone ends up as \"legends\"in the end ? No, keep doing as you have , Mangla.       -Moloch, the inheritor of Taziel's Death Curse.P.S. sorry for the muddled expression, been a while since my last cup ofcoffee... :)**oops, my fault ... Ben is okmy apologizeseko da beest**Ok.  dispenser fixed.  beast is fixing cloak with even morenew goodies. hope you all like.Now for the serious question. I need a vote on a \"legends\"type system being installed. IF you are dead set against itthen please give it some thought, and IF you are all for itplease do the same thing. There are a few choices I would liketo put forth to vote on:a: yes I want what some of the other guilds have as far as legends.b: I like the idea of staying a player but still getting more        levels and poer, but not to the extreme others have.c: I would like to stay a player and still have goals, but NO where        near what is currently being used by other guilds.d: I would rather not have legneds at all.Please post here or mail me with you decisions. becuase like itor not i you do not vote I will do what most people ask for andyou will not be heard.-Mangla knows not to go into a list with a prepostion, but he         did anyway.  ;-p.**Legneds are levels above 29thIf you do not wish to wiz then you play on as a legendyou gain more power and HP and SP as you gain legend leves.-Mangla hopes that explains it some**New cloak is in:'transfer' function : you can transfer items/coinsto another player. You can't transfer quest itemsand weapons, you can't transfer when fighting,etc. It costs you some SP (even if you fail) andamount depeneds on item weight/amount of coins.'thiefproof' function: If thief tries to steal from you,it will display his/her name (even if he is hidden!) and shocks him/her (light damage, depends on your WIS). However it costs some sp therefore use it with care *smile*(note: 'shock' doesn't start a fight, only hurts thief)YoursSeko da Beest invents for you (tm pHiLiPs)**Hello mangla1. I don't think that we should have legend lvls like in Fighters guild, or Monks guild, players can be a legend there without having reached the highest lvl.On the other hand the max. HPs and SPs for a Jedi are a joke anyway.At vampire quest it was not possible for me to even swing the lightsaber once befor I was down on 0 HPs.I think that a bad Jedi here on HM doesn't look like Darth Vader from Star Warsbut like Rick Moranis in Spaceballs.It is no fun doing a quest having no chance to finish or even survive it.So do a few improvements, maybe some additional features for higher lvls,or let the cloak be a better armour the higher the lvl.and as you want to have a vote i choose <B>.Tegerl**Hi Mangla!I really do not need any legends!!! So my vote: DHope I could help you!                                        Mikey**I just want to know your opinion.I am thinking about Battle Fields or Arena or whatever where playerscan fight each other without risk of pk-ing. Shoud be not very large area where they can challenge player/group/guild/whole mudand where you can die without losing xp/level/stats. weapons/armors/items will be restricted (you can use only weaponsyou can buy there) etc. there will be TOP 20 WAR players or something. it is supposed only for higher level players (legends?)if you know Tsunami MUD you know what i am talking about.just an idea (anyway i am allready working on it :=)da beest (invents for you)**Well, I agree with the legends being abit too much, but since every guild is now getting them might as well join the crowd. o